        "slc_b472669deb6b795c02d52df80ddfff0a49aa2667e23ab3ac424b232e457331b0"
      ],
      "text": "VibeSDK is described as an open-source agentic platform for building and deploying full-stack applications on Cloudflare, with a hosted demo at build.cloudflare.dev."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fcfcfeafca14000d0e05e799db222ca626e0515d30aaf44126ab80a417d2a38e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "specifications",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "9da158d82c597a0e8f4bf033cdccd1053fb6fb15",
          "git_sha": "63c5fd8aaea54b2d35ff74b183ae3c2f20453488",
          "line_end": 15,
          "line_start": 15,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "cloudflare/vibesdk",
          "url": "https://github.com/cloudflare/vibesdk/blob/9da158d82c597a0e8f4bf033cdccd1053fb6fb15/README.md#L15-L15"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_45cab70e4ef7088456e9669ecc9bb0f5310116669d6a2adbf4c21655a9dd57fd"
      ],
      "text": "Users build apps by describing what they want and answering clarifying questions while the agent plans, edits files, deploys previews, inspects errors, and iterates with the human in the loop."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_94a04e26ea207c07d22ce0d485d65286df9d06156211a8a138edc085dbab4a46",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "9da158d82c597a0e8f4bf033cdccd1053fb6fb15",
          "git_sha": "63c5fd8aaea54b2d35ff74b183ae3c2f20453488",
          "line_end": 41,
          "line_start": 34,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "cloudflare/vibesdk",
          "url": "https://github.com/cloudflare/vibesdk/blob/9da158d82c597a0e8f4bf033cdccd1053fb6fb15/README.md#L34-L41"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0be74d22e62db8c0e391f1cc2f610103e7819d48f575eccbf578b66d7ac52461"
      ],
      "text": "The architecture comprises a ThinkAgent Durable Object running the model-and-tool loop, a SpaceDO workspace per project, Cloudflare Artifacts for git history and restore points, a Worker Loader for Dynamic Worker previews, and a generated App Durable Object Facet with SQLite."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b266d8afaafce287057a065a89a686166376d70c71c51784947580f8444a912d",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "9da158d82c597a0e8f4bf033cdccd1053fb6fb15",
          "git_sha": "63c5fd8aaea54b2d35ff74b183ae3c2f20453488",
          "line_end": 56,
          "line_start": 56,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "cloudflare/vibesdk",
          "url": "https://github.com/cloudflare/vibesdk/blob/9da158d82c597a0e8f4bf033cdccd1053fb6fb15/README.md#L56-L56"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0c6775cb999e34b288c342a5439d2adf9164efb9b43d492a0584bd846b680fc8"
      ],
      "text": "ThinkAgent runs an iterative model-and-tool loop, managing conversation history, streaming, and skills; its explicit tools edit the workspace, create restore points, deploy previews, inspect browser logs, and ask clarifying questions, while bash access is disabled."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
