        "slc_f653d727904ef90b968e3cc65939ef90dc56720b8fbda704175354ef995aab05"
      ],
      "text": "The product's tool model uses explicit workspace and product tools with workspace bash access disabled, and preview URLs use signed, branch-scoped access for authorization."
    },
